#ifndef HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32
#define HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32 32

// Native NFT marketplace, and the new voting bar.
//
// A root post can be minted as an NFT by its author with nft_operation, which takes the operation
// number 37 that reset_account_operation used to hold as a placeholder. The same operation lists an
// edition for sale at a fixed price, cancels the listing, buys it and transfers it; edition 0 is the
// reserve, the copies that never left the author, offered at one price. A sale pays the royalty fixed
// at mint to the creator and the rest to the seller, and is reported with the virtual operations
// nft_sold_operation and nft_royalty_operation.
//
// The voting bar: a full vote costs 3% of the bar instead of 2%, the bar refills in 6 days 16 hours
// (15% a day) instead of 5 days, and a removed delegation returns after 7 days instead of 5. The
// refill time becomes the global property voting_mana_regeneration_seconds; the hardfork brings every
// bar up to date at the old rate first, then writes the three values (database_hardfork.cpp).
//
// Hardforks are applied in order, so hardfork 31 (see 1_31.hf) has to be scheduled no later than this
// one: set HIVE_HARDFORK_1_31_TIME and HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_TIME together when the rollout date is agreed.
//
// Far-future default so that the hardfork never activates on a chain that did not schedule it.
// 4102444800 = 2100-01-01T00:00:00Z
#define HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_DEFAULT_TIME 4102444800L

#ifdef USE_ALTERNATE_CHAIN_ID
#define HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_TIME (hive::protocol::testnet_blockchain_configuration::configuration_data.get_hf_time(HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32, HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_DEFAULT_TIME))
#else
#define HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_TIME HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_DEFAULT_TIME
#endif

#define HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_VERSION hive::protocol::hardfork_version( 1, 32 )

// nft_operation is accepted; minted posts can no longer be edited or deleted
#define HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_NFT (HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32)
// full vote 3% of the bar, refill 15% a day, delegations return after 7 days (values set at the fork)
#define HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32_VOTING_BAR (HIVE_HARDFORK_1_32)
#endif
